WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.011 --> 00:00:11.580
Open Appearance from More and choose an accent color

2
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:21.060
Choose Light, Dark, or the system appearance

3
00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:33.938
Choose Color for the background and pick a color

4
00:00:33.938 --> 00:00:48.000
Choose Photo for the background, then pick a picture

5
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Pinch and drag to adjust the picture's size and position

6
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Choose a color to overlay on the photo, then adjust its opacity and preview the result

7
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Choose a photo for the chat avatar too

8
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:25.683
Adjust the picture using the circular preview, then save

9
00:01:25.683 --> 00:01:53.533
The avatar appears in chat, with the colors and background across the app
